{"seq":1,"slug":"animation-performance","title":"动画性能优化：jank 诊断、合成层管理与 GPU 预算","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/web-animation-engineering/performance/animation-performance","wordCount":1015,"readingTime":5,"html":"<h1 id=\"动画性能优化-jank-诊断-合成层管理与-gpu-预算\">动画性能优化：jank 诊断、合成层管理与 GPU 预算</h1><p>动画性能优化不是猜测，而是测量与修复的循环。本文提供系统化的 jank 诊断方法、Chrome DevTools 的具体操作步骤，以及合成层管理的工程决策框架。</p>\n<h2 id=\"jank-的定义与量化\">jank 的定义与量化</h2><p><strong>jank</strong>（卡顿）发生在帧渲染时间超出显示器刷新间隔时。在 60Hz 显示器上，帧预算为 16.67ms；在 120Hz 显示器（如 iPad Pro、高端 Android）上为 8.33ms。</p>\n<p>量化 jank 的核心指标：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>指标</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n<th>工具</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>帧率（FPS）</td>\n<td>每秒渲染帧数，目标 ≥60</td>\n<td>DevTools Performance</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>长任务（Long Task）</td>\n<td>主线程任务 &gt; 50ms</td>\n<td>Performance Observer</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>帧间隔方差</td>\n<td>帧与帧之间的时间波动</td>\n<td>自定义 rAF 监控</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>CLS（累积布局偏移）</td>\n<td>非预期的布局变化</td>\n<td>Core Web Vitals</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"javascript\" data-code=\"// 自定义帧率监控&#10;let lastTime = performance.now();&#10;let frameCount = 0;&#10;&#10;function measureFPS() {&#10;  const now = performance.now();&#10;  const elapsed = now - lastTime;&#10;  frameCount++;&#10;&#10;  if (elapsed &gt;= 1000) {&#10;    const fps = Math.round((frameCount * 1000) / elapsed);&#10;    console.log(`当前帧率: ${fps} FPS`);&#10;    frameCount = 0;&#10;    lastTime = now;&#10;  }&#10;&#10;  requestAnimationFrame(measureFPS);&#10;}&#10;requestAnimationFrame(measureFPS);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 自定义帧率监控</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> lastTime </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> performance.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">now</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> frameCount </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> measureFPS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> now</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> performance.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">now</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> elapsed</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> now </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> lastTime;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  frameCount</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">++</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (elapsed </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">>=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1000</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> fps</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> Math.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">round</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">((frameCount </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1000</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">/</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> elapsed);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    console.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">log</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">`当前帧率: ${</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">fps</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">} FPS`</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    frameCount </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    lastTime </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> now;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  requestAnimationFrame</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(measureFPS);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">requestAnimationFrame</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(measureFPS);</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"chrome-devtools-性能分析实操\">Chrome DevTools 性能分析实操</h2><h3 id=\"performance-面板诊断流程\">Performance 面板诊断流程</h3><ol>\n<li>打开 DevTools → Performance 面板</li>\n<li>点击 Record，执行动画，点击 Stop</li>\n<li>在 <strong>Frames</strong> 轨道查找红色帧（耗时超预算的帧）</li>\n<li>点击红色帧，在 <strong>Main</strong> 轨道查看该帧的任务分解</li>\n<li>找到最耗时的任务（Recalculate Style / Layout / Paint）</li>\n</ol>\n<h3 id=\"关键标志解读\">关键标志解读</h3><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[性能火焰图分析] --&gt; B[&quot;紫色: Recalculate Style&lt;br/&gt;样式计算触发,检查 CSS 变更范围&quot;]&#10;    A --&gt; C[&quot;黄色/橙色: Layout&lt;br/&gt;布局重排,查找触发的 CSS 属性&quot;]&#10;    A --&gt; D[&quot;绿色: Paint&lt;br/&gt;重绘,查看绘制区域大小&quot;]&#10;    A --&gt; E[&quot;蓝色: Composite&lt;br/&gt;合成,这部分永远是好的&quot;]\">graph TD\n    A[性能火焰图分析] --&gt; B[\"紫色: Recalculate Style&lt;br/&gt;样式计算触发,检查 CSS 变更范围\"]\n    A --&gt; C[\"黄色/橙色: Layout&lt;br/&gt;布局重排,查找触发的 CSS 属性\"]\n    A --&gt; D[\"绿色: Paint&lt;br/&gt;重绘,查看绘制区域大小\"]\n    A --&gt; E[\"蓝色: Composite&lt;br/&gt;合成,这部分永远是好的\"]</pre><h3 id=\"layers-面板-可视化合成层\">Layers 面板：可视化合成层</h3><p><strong>Layers 面板</strong>（More tools → Layers）显示页面所有合成层及其 GPU 显存占用：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>查看每个合成层的原因（<code>will-change</code>/3D transform/固定定位等）</li>\n<li>检查合成层总数——超过 100 个通常意味着过度提升</li>\n<li>查看每层的显存估算——移动设备 GPU 显存有限</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"常见性能问题诊断模式\">常见性能问题诊断模式</h2><h3 id=\"模式-1-动画属性触发-layout\">模式 1：动画属性触发 Layout</h3><p><strong>症状</strong>：Performance 面板中，每帧都有 Layout 任务。</p>\n<p><strong>诊断</strong>：检查动画的 CSS 属性是否在 Layout 触发列表中。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"css\" data-code=\"/* 触发 Layout（性能差）*/&#10;@keyframes bad {&#10;  from {&#10;    left: 0;&#10;  }&#10;  to {&#10;    left: 200px;&#10;  }&#10;}&#10;&#10;/* 仅 Composite（性能优）*/&#10;@keyframes good {&#10;  from {&#10;    transform: translateX(0);&#10;  }&#10;  to {&#10;    transform: translateX(200px);&#10;  }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">/* 触发 Layout（性能差）*/</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">@keyframes</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\"> bad</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  from</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    left</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  to</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    left</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">200</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">px</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">/* 仅 Composite（性能优）*/</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">@keyframes</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\"> good</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  from</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    transform</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">translateX</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  to</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    transform</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">translateX</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">200</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">px</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>修复</strong>：将所有动画属性替换为 <code>transform</code> 等效形式。</p>\n<h3 id=\"模式-2-javascript-阻塞主线程\">模式 2：JavaScript 阻塞主线程</h3><p><strong>症状</strong>：动画帧率波动，Performance 面板中 JS 任务时长 &gt; 10ms。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"javascript\" data-code=\"// 诊断：识别主线程阻塞&#10;const observer = new PerformanceObserver((list) =&gt; {&#10;  for (const entry of list.getEntries()) {&#10;    if (entry.duration &gt; 50) {&#10;      console.warn(`长任务检测: ${entry.name}, ${entry.duration.toFixed(0)}ms`);&#10;    }&#10;  }&#10;});&#10;observer.observe({ entryTypes: [&#39;longtask&#39;] });\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 诊断：识别主线程阻塞</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> observer</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> new</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> PerformanceObserver</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">((</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">list</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> entry</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> of</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> list.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">getEntries</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (entry.duration </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 50</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      console.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">warn</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">`长任务检测: ${</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">entry</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">.</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">name</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">}, ${</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">entry</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">.</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">duration</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">toFixed</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">)</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">}ms`</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">});</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">observer.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">observe</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({ entryTypes: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'longtask'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">] });</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>修复</strong>：将重计算任务移到 Web Worker，或拆分为多个 <code>requestIdleCallback</code> 任务。</p>\n<h3 id=\"模式-3-合成层过多-layer-explosion\">模式 3：合成层过多（Layer Explosion）</h3><p><strong>症状</strong>：Layers 面板显示数百个合成层，GPU 显存占用高，低端设备卡顿。</p>\n<p><strong>常见原因</strong>：滥用 <code>will-change: transform</code>，或在循环中动画子元素。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"css\" data-code=\"/* 问题：每个列表项都被提升为合成层 */&#10;.list-item {&#10;  will-change: transform; /* 1000 个列表项 = 1000 个合成层 */&#10;}&#10;&#10;/* 修复：只在动画进行时提升，完成后移除 */&#10;.list-item.animating {&#10;  will-change: transform;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">/* 问题：每个列表项都被提升为合成层 */</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">.list-item</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  will-change</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: transform; </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">/* 1000 个列表项 = 1000 个合成层 */</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">/* 修复：只在动画进行时提升，完成后移除 */</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">.list-item.animating</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  will-change</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: transform;</span></span>\n<span c